  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "2705-root",
    "title": "EyeSurg Tournament",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "CIME organised Pakistan's first-ever EyeSurg Tournament for ophthalmology residents and medical officers.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "d70ad3b1af655b4c",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "2705-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/2705-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "EyeSurg Tournament"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "CIME Pakistan in collaboration with the Section of Ophthalmology organised the country's first-ever EyeSurg Tournament for ophthalmology residents and medical officers. This tournament was held as part of the PGME silver jubilee celebration. Participants performed a variety of procedures related to anterior chamber surgery on CIME's EyeSi simulator - the first of its kind in Pakistan."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At the end of three nail-biting rounds, Dr Hina Qazi emerged victorious. We would especially like to thank Dr. Abdul Sami Memon, Dr. M. Bilal Malik and Dr. Benish Aslam for their incredible support in planning and conducting the event. We look forward to conducting many more tournaments for post graduate trainees soon! "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
